  unitName: Furious Blaze Golzo
  unitId: 10865
  unitNumber: 1348
  description: Picking up a mysterious gem near the tower in Lizeria, he felt an
    inexplicable surge of power. Immediately afterwards, a swordswoman and a spear
    user with the same gems appeared, telling him that the gem was proof he had been
    chosen by the Holy Emperor. He was initially cautious when faced with this sudden
    revelation, but decided to aid in the founding of the Guardians when he recalled
    an old folktale telling of a servant of the gods. Thus, he left his people behind
    and joined the two warriors on their journey.
  summonDesc: I merely obey the Flame Wolf's commands... That is the pride of my
    people. And it is my pride, as well...
  fusionDesc: This strange sensation...<br>It's like when I touched that gem...<br>It
    feels like something warm is rising up within me.
  evoDesc: Whatever the change,<br>I will simply accept it...<br>I cannot resist
    fate.
  element: 1
  rarity: 5
